<title>CANADA: Imasco ups div, plans common share buyback.</title>
<headline>Imasco ups div, plans common share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		     Prior</p>
<p> Amount		 C$0.30		    C$0.27</p>
<p> Pay		  March 31</p>
<p> Record		 Feb 28</p>
<p>Imasco Ltd said on Friday that its board of directors authorized a new normal course issuer bid for the repurchase of up to 4 million common shares, representing about 1.73 percent of the 230,660,509 shares outstanding, and allocated up to C$125 million for the buyback. Purchases may begin on February 4, 1997 and end no later than February 3, 1998.</p>
<p>Under its previous 12-month normal course issuer bid, Imasco bought back 3,572,850 common shares, representing about 1.5 percent of those oustanding. ((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
</text>
